[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_item_data")
item_name = "Arvid's Note"
item_description = "Another note from Arvid, which ends abruptly."
item_type = 1
note_text = "\"Log Note — 22:14

Left the computer terminal active.

Going down to the old tunnel (gamla tunneln) past the eastern thicket to pull a manual audio sample. There’s a persistent acoustic feedback looping out of the concrete structure. From the porch, it just sounds like standard low-frequency wind resonance, but the frequency shifts are perfectly matching the interval patterns I logged at Nest Gamma earlier today.

It's highly likely a structural fluke—the acoustics of the hollow corridor mimicking the local wildlife distribution—but I need to rule out equipment interference before finalizing the report for the regional office.

If anyone from administration calls before I get back, tell them the data migration is still on schedule. Taking the spare battery cells.

— Arvid\""
scene_to_spawn = ExtResource("2_note_scene")
